The '''Citadel of the Sun''' lies over the shores of the [[Thalassian Highlands]]. Formerly the beating heart of [[Alah'Thalas]], it is now home to ambassadors of the [[Alliance]]. The Citadel formerly housed the new Magistry, the headquarters of the Rangers, and the seat of the Speaker.

